config LIBCSUIT
	bool "Enable libcsuit library"
	help
	  Enable IETF SUIT manifest encoding and decoding support using libcsuit.
	  This library provides support for parsing, processing, and generating
	  SUIT (Software Updates for Internet of Things) manifests.
